printing.caption_limit = Nkyerɛkyerɛmu no ware dodo ma saa ɔdan nhyehyɛe yi. Tew nsusuwii a ɛkɔ fam anaa nkyɛn so, ma nkyerɛkyerɛmu no yɛ tiawa anaa dum no.
printing.font_error = Font biara nni hɔ ma nkyerɛkyerɛmu no. Fa nkyerɛwde font gu afiri no so anaa dum nkyerɛkyerɛmu no.
printing.no_document = Bue krataa anaa paw mfonini wɔ mfonini akorae mu ansa na woatintim.
